OL,3,AHow much could Trump's 'economic D-Day'
OL,4,Ahurt Iran?
OL,5,
OL,6,FIran, however, has long faced sanctions
OL,7,Fand has so far shown a willingness to
OL,8,Fendure pain and a capacity to adapt to
OL,9,Fimmense economic and military pressure
OL,10,Fas the conflict drags on.
OL,12,FThe key question for the US then
OL,13,Fbecomes, will further sanctions work
OL,14,Fwhere other strategies have failed?
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
